=== layout: section

# What is the difference between exome and genome?

=== layout: one-panel

# Human Genome Information

@body

- Diploid Genome\:
  - 6.46966 billion DNA base pairs
- Haploid Genome\:
  - 3,234.83 Mb (Mega-basepairs)
- Exome\:
  - 30Mb
    - Exons overlap, so total sequence is probably \~50Mb
    - 180,000 exons constituting about 1% of the total genome
- Genotyping
  - 0.6 Mb
    - 600,000 bp of SNPs

