# Genotype Coverage and Costs (2020)

@body

| Assay | Sites | % | 2020 $ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Genome | 3,200,000,000 | 100.000% | $399 |
| All SNPs | 149,735,377 | 4.679% |  |
| Exome | 39,000,000 | 1.219% | $400 |
| Omni SNP | 2,381,000 | 0.074% |  |
| FTDNA | 720,350 | 0.023% | $59 |
| Ancestry | 664,000 | 0.021% | $59 |
| 23andMe | 654,027 | 0.020% | $99 |
| SNPedia | 111,300 | 0.003% |  |

